---
import "../styles/global.css";
import SiteAnalytics from "../components/SiteAnalytics.astro";
---
<html lang="en"><head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/>
<title>Bring Your Design (BYD) — Custom Shirts | ReasonableNoise</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow"/>
<meta name="description" content="Bring your artwork for custom T-shirt printing. Securely request a quote and upload a design after selecting your print options. No payment until review."/>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/assets/rn-logo.png"/>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-[#080b12] text-white antialiased">
<header class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-6"><a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3 font-semibold"><img src="/assets/rn-logo.png" class="h-12 w-12 object-contain" alt=""/>ReasonableNoise</a><nav aria-label="Shirt printing" class="flex gap-5 text-sm text-white/70"><a href="/shirt-designs">Design collections</a><a href="/dtf-shirts">Printing quotes</a><a href="/">Home</a></nav></header>
<main>
<section class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-5 py-20 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center">
<div><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.28em] text-cyan-300">BYD / Bring Your Design</p><h1 class="mt-5 text-5xl font-black leading-tight tracking-[-.05em] sm:text-7xl">Your artwork.<br/><span class="text-cyan-300">Your shirt.</span></h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-white/65">Already have a design? Tell us about your shirt, add your file through our existing protected quote form, and we'll review print readiness before confirming price and production.</p><div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/contact?topic=dtf" class="rounded-full bg-cyan-300 px-6 py-3 font-bold text-[#07141a]">Start BYD quote and artwork upload</a><a href="/shirt-designs" class="rounded-full border border-white/20 px-6 py-3 font-semibold">Browse design ideas</a></div><p class="mt-4 text-xs text-white/45">Quote request only. No checkout, charge, instant print authorization or automatic fulfillment.</p></div>
<div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-cyan-300/20 bg-white/[.05] p-7 sm:p-9"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-200">Your design workflow</p><ol class="mt-6 space-y-6">{[
["01","Share the artwork","Use the secure DTF quote form. Optional upload supports PNG, JPG, WEBP, PDF, SVG, AI, EPS and PSD (up to 15 MB) when security verification is available."],
["02","Choose your shirt","Tell us quantity, shirt source, size/color preferences, placement, and any deadline."],
["03","Approve a print proof","We check file quality, rights, garment suitability and print layout before approval."],
["04","Confirm price before payment","We send a quote for review. Nothing on this page creates a Stripe Checkout Session."]
].map(([n,title,description])=><li class="flex gap-4"><span class="font-black text-cyan-300">{n}</span><div><h2 class="font-bold">{title}</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-white/55">{description}</p></div></li>)}</ol></div>
</section>
<section class="border-t border-white/10 bg-[#101923] px-5 py-16"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">What can I bring?</h2><div class="mt-7 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">{[
["Original artwork","Your own illustration, brand mark, lettering or photo."],
["School and team art","Only artwork you own or have permission to reproduce, including mascots and logos."],
["Print placement ideas","Front, back, sleeve, or multi-location printing; quote confirmed after review."]
].map(([t,d])=><article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-5"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold">{t}</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-white/60">{d}</p></article>)}</div><p class="mt-6 text-sm text-white/50">The current quote form may disable artwork upload if its security verification is not configured. Text-based quote requests remain available; don't send sensitive documents via public links.</p></div></section>
<section class="border-t border-white/10 px-5 py-20" aria-labelledby="brief-title">
<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.15fr]">
<div><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-cyan-300">Helpful before your quote</p><h2 id="brief-title" class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Build a simple print brief.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-xl leading-7 text-white/60">Choose your preferences below, then copy the summary into the message field of our existing DTF quote form. This tool runs only in your browser; it does not upload artwork, save details, or submit an order.</p>
<div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-cyan-300/20 bg-cyan-300/[.07] p-5"><h3 class="font-bold text-cyan-100">Artwork preparation checklist</h3><ul class="mt-4 list-inside list-disc space-y-2 text-sm leading-6 text-white/70"><li>Use original artwork or obtain permission for any school, team, character, or brand mark.</li><li>Provide a high-resolution file at the intended print size; transparent background where appropriate.</li><li>Confirm garment color, print placement, and quantity.</li><li>Keep artwork without tiny unreadable text or excessive details; final print proof is required.</li></ul><p class="mt-4 text-xs text-white/50">A checkerboard preview does not prove transparency. We review the actual file before printing.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-white/15 bg-white/[.06] p-6 sm:p-8" data-byd-brief>
<p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/50">Quick brief · No submission</p>
<div class="mt-6 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
<label class="grid gap-2"><span class="text-sm font-semibold">Quantity</span><input id="byd-quantity" type="number" min="1" max="500" value="12" inputmode="numeric" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-white/20 bg-[#0f1925] px-4 py-3 text-white outline-none focus:border-cyan-300"/></label>
<label class="grid gap-2"><span class="text-sm font-semibold">Shirt source</span><select id="byd-source" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-white/20 bg-[#0f1925] px-4 py-3 text-white outline-none focus:border-cyan-300"><option value="ReasonableNoise supplies shirts">ReasonableNoise supplies</option><option value="Customer brings shirts">I bring shirts</option><option value="Not decided">Not decided</option></select></label>
<label class="grid gap-2"><span class="text-sm font-semibold">Shirt color</span><select id="byd-color" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-white/20 bg-[#0f1925] px-4 py-3 text-white outline-none focus:border-cyan-300"><option>Black</option><option>White</option><option>Heather gray</option><option>Mixed colors</option><option>Other (describe in quote)</option></select></label>
<label class="grid gap-2"><span class="text-sm font-semibold">Print placement</span><select id="byd-placement" class="w-full rounded-xl border border-white/20 bg-[#0f1925] px-4 py-3 text-white outline-none focus:border-cyan-300"><option>Front</option><option>Back</option><option>Front + back</option><option>Sleeve / other</option><option>Not sure yet</option></select></label>
</div>
<label class="mt-6 flex items-start gap-3 text-sm leading-6 text-white/70"><input id="byd-rights" type="checkbox" class="mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 accent-cyan-300"/><span>I own the artwork or have permission to reproduce it. I understand that school, team and brand marks may require separate approval.</span></label>
<button id="byd-build-brief" type="button" class="mt-6 w-full rounded-full bg-cyan-300 px-6 py-3 font-bold text-[#07141a] hover:bg-cyan-200">Prepare my quote notes</button>
<p id="byd-brief-status" class="mt-3 text-sm text-amber-100" role="status" aria-live="polite">No details sent. Artwork review and payment are not started.</p>
<div class="mt-5 rounded-xl border border-white/15 bg-black/20 p-4"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/45">Copy this into your DTF request</p><pre id="byd-brief-output" class="mt-3 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-sans text-sm leading-6 text-white/70">Your quote notes will appear here after selecting Prepare.</pre></div>
<button id="byd-copy-brief" type="button" disabled class="mt-4 w-full rounded-full border border-white/25 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white hover:border-white disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40">Copy quote notes</button>
<a href="/contact?topic=dtf" class="mt-4 block text-center text-sm font-semibold text-cyan-200 underline underline-offset-4">Open protected DTF quote & artwork upload</a>
</div></div></section>
<script>
const briefArea=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-byd-brief]");
if(briefArea){
  const quantity=briefArea.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("#byd-quantity");
  const source=briefArea.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>("#byd-source");
  const color=briefArea.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>("#byd-color");
  const placement=briefArea.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>("#byd-placement");
  const rights=briefArea.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>("#byd-rights");
  const build=briefArea.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("#byd-build-brief");
  const copy=briefArea.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>("#byd-copy-brief");
  const out=briefArea.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#byd-brief-output");
  const status=briefArea.querySelector<HTMLElement>("#byd-brief-status");
  let prepared="";
  function resetPrepared(){
    prepared="";
    if(copy)copy.disabled=true;
    if(out)out.textContent="Your quote notes will appear here after selecting Prepare.";
    if(status)status.textContent="Preferences changed. Prepare the notes again before copying.";
  }
  [quantity,source,color,placement,rights].forEach(el=>el?.addEventListener("change",resetPrepared));
  build?.addEventListener("click",()=>{
    const n=Number(quantity?.value);
    if(!Number.isSafeInteger(n)||n<1||n>500){
      resetPrepared();if(status)status.textContent="Enter a whole-number quantity between 1 and 500.";return;
    }
    if(!rights?.checked){
      resetPrepared();if(status)status.textContent="Please confirm that you own the artwork or have permission to reproduce it.";return;
    }
    prepared=[
      "Bring Your Design (BYD) - DTF quote request",
      "Quantity: "+n,
      "Shirt source: "+(source?.value||"Not decided"),
      "Color: "+(color?.value||"Not decided"),
      "Placement: "+(placement?.value||"Not decided"),
      "Artwork rights: Customer confirms ownership or permission",
      "Artwork: I will attach it through the secure quote form if upload is available",
      "Please confirm garment size mix, print proof, lead time, and final price before payment."
    ].join("\n");
    if(out)out.textContent=prepared;
    if(copy)copy.disabled=false;
    if(status)status.textContent="Quote notes prepared locally. Copy them and paste into the DTF message field.";
  });
  copy?.addEventListener("click",async()=>{
    if(!prepared)return;
    try{
      if(!navigator.clipboard?.writeText)throw new Error("clipboard unavailable");
      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(prepared);
      if(status)status.textContent="Quote notes copied. Paste them into the protected DTF quote form.";
    }catch{
      if(status)status.textContent="Clipboard unavailable. Select the prepared text above and copy it manually.";
    }
  });
}
</script>
<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-16 text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold">Ready to get your design reviewed?</h2><p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-white/60">Start with the existing custom shirt quote process. We won't ask you to pay before reviewing the design and production requirements.</p><a href="/contact?topic=dtf" class="mt-7 inline-block rounded-full bg-white px-7 py-3 font-bold text-[#07141a]">Request BYD Quote</a></section>
</main><footer class="border-t border-white/10 px-5 py-8 text-center text-sm text-white/45">ReasonableNoise · Custom print requests · <a href="/privacy" class="underline">Privacy</a></footer><SiteAnalytics/></body></html>